476
00:20:23,430 --> 00:20:26,099
[Heather] I'm not gonna...
I won't screw anything up.

477
00:20:26,183 --> 00:20:27,809
-[Brett] You will.
-So, is this is my room?

478
00:20:28,101 --> 00:20:30,979
