A map of LA from 100 years ago.

479
00:20:31,063 --> 00:20:32,481
Oh, wow.

480
00:20:32,564 --> 00:20:35,776
Brett, this place is huge.
It's so unexpected.

481
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:38,904
