-We want very different things.

506
00:21:40,465 --> 00:21:42,676
Our bond is so strong.

507
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:44,803
You're probably one
of my best guy friends.

508
00:21:44,886 --> 00:21:46,179
I'm glad you feel that way.

509
00:21:46,596 --> 00:21:48,682
-You're in a good place, right?
-[Heather chuckles]

510
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:50,892
