you're really doing well with this guy.

515
00:22:01,695 --> 00:22:03,822
Yeah, it's long distance
and I'm in Orange County,

516
00:22:03,905 --> 00:22:07,659
so it's back and forth,
which takes my mind out of work.

517
00:22:07,743 --> 00:22:11,163
