526
00:22:25,552 --> 00:22:28,013
My concern is that last time
you were in a relationship,

527
00:22:28,096 --> 00:22:29,973
you kind of started 
screwing up a little bit.

528
00:22:30,057 --> 00:22:33,518
I expect you to be operating at an 
incredible level because I know you can.

529
00:22:33,602 --> 00:22:37,356
Sometimes you're not and it's usually
'cause a man is involved. That's all.

530
00:22:37,439 --> 00:22:40,317
It's hard to balance this now
with his kids, too.

531
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,526
I'm like playing...

532
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:43,528
-You're kinda playing Mom a little bit.
-I'm Mom, yeah.

533
00:22:43,612 --> 00:22:47,324
He went through, like, a huge divorce
and never thought he'd marry again

534
00:22:47,407 --> 00:22:49,826
and never thought he'd fall in love again,
then he met me.

535
00:22:49,910 --> 00:22:51,328
