Unless it screws around with your career.

538
00:22:56,124 --> 00:22:59,461
Maya has a freaking baby and she's
doing it, so you can do it with a man.

539
00:22:59,544 --> 00:23:02,631
I just don't like when people 
question my relationship.

540
00:23:02,714 --> 00:23:03,673
I feel very judged,

541
00:23:03,757 --> 00:23:05,884
and I'm very protective of my relationship,

542
00:23:05,967 --> 00:23:09,429
and I'm very protective of those children
that are now in my life.

543
00:23:09,888 --> 00:23:12,182
-My expectations for you are high.
-Mm-hmm.

544
00:23:12,724 --> 00:23:14,851
And so anything less than that
pisses me off.

545
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:18,355
♪ All the little haters on Hater Street ♪

546
00:23:18,438 --> 00:23:22,025
♪ Know I got the kind of rhythm
That can rock that beat ♪

547
00:23:22,109 --> 00:23:24,611
♪ Fire! In my veins ♪

548
00:23:24,903 --> 00:23:27,447
♪ Thunder! Feel me shake ♪

549
00:23:27,531 --> 00:23:30,992
♪ Get ready, I'm a woman
I don't need no favors ♪

550
00:23:31,076 --> 00:23:34,746
♪ You should have seen me coming
I'm a force of nature ♪

551
00:23:34,830 --> 00:23:37,874
♪ Get ready, I'm a force of nature ♪

552
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,585
♪ I'm a force of nature ♪

553
00:23:41,002 --> 00:23:42,796
[telephone ringing]

554
00:23:42,879 --> 00:23:44,005
Hey, babe.

555
00:23:44,089 --> 00:23:46,675
[Jason] Hey, guess what we just got
