562
00:23:59,813 --> 00:24:01,314
-We just got it signed.
-[Mary] Boom!

563
00:24:01,439 --> 00:24:03,650
Oh, my God, I can't wait. 
I'll come down, we'll celebrate.

564
00:24:03,733 --> 00:24:05,819
