594
00:25:01,208 --> 00:25:02,792
Somehow, it just worked out.

595
00:25:02,876 --> 00:25:05,337
I got one client here 
and one client there,

596
00:25:05,420 --> 00:25:09,382
and built a resume and then was able to do
what I absolutely love

597
00:25:09,883 --> 00:25:12,594
and become this mama interior decorator.

598
00:25:12,677 --> 00:25:14,804
