603
00:25:22,604 --> 00:25:27,484
I can list the house, stage the house,
sell the house, then decorate the house.

604
00:25:27,567 --> 00:25:31,947
So it's like, cha-ching, cha-ching,
and mama and babies win.

605
00:25:32,030 --> 00:25:34,366
I have something to run by you.

606
00:25:35,408 --> 00:25:36,326
[Mary] Um...

607
00:25:36,409 --> 00:25:39,746
So, Romain and I were looking 
at wedding venues

608
00:25:39,829 --> 00:25:43,291
and we were talking about taking 
the wedding list down even more.

609
00:25:43,375 --> 00:25:47,921
And he was like, well, I know one person
that's not gonna be on the list,

610
00:25:48,004 --> 00:25:48,880
Davina.

611
00:25:50,215 --> 00:25:53,260
-And I was like, "What?"
-What?

612
00:25:53,343 --> 00:25:55,136
