616
00:26:03,979 --> 00:26:06,523
"Oh, this is the food they have?
Oh, this is it?

617
00:26:06,606 --> 00:26:08,692
Oh, this is where they chose
to get married?"

618
00:26:08,775 --> 00:26:10,569
