621
00:26:14,322 --> 00:26:16,783
-Does she even realize she's doing it?
-I don't know.

622
00:26:16,866 --> 00:26:19,286
He has to sit her down and just tell her.

623
00:26:19,369 --> 00:26:21,663
I told him he's gonna tell her.
I'm not frickin' telling her.

624
00:26:21,746 --> 00:26:24,541
-Aw, I feel so bad for you.
-I know!

625
00:26:24,624 --> 00:26:25,458
[Amanza] Fuck!

626
00:26:26,167 --> 00:26:28,169
[Mary] This is my fucking nightmare.

627
00:26:28,253 --> 00:26:31,965
I think Romain's decision to not have 
Davina at the wedding is valid.

628
00:26:32,048 --> 00:26:35,468
When he proposed to Mary,
he didn't have the money for

629
